// Role "London" with user "hannah.martin@company.com"
//   → Should show 45 orders, ~$283K revenue
//
// Role "ByLocation" with UPN "noah.white@company.com"
//   → Should show Hamburg data only (USER-001)
//
// No role (Admin view) → All 500 orders visible
